{"question": "Beat Saber เล่นยังไง", "answer": "Beat Saber: Beat Saber คือเกม VR จังหวะดนตรีที่ผู้เล่นใช้ดาบแสงฟันบล็อกตามจังหวะเพลง\nแนวเกม: เกม VR Rhythm\nวิธีเล่นโดยสรุป: สวมแว่น VR ถือคอนโทรลเลอร์ แล้วฟันบล็อกตามทิศทาง หลบสิ่งกีดขวาง และพยายามทำคะแนนตามจังหวะเพลง\nเล่นได้ที่: VR Zone\nแหล่งข้อมูล: https://esports.phuket.psu.ac.th/Services/our-games", "mode": "pipeline:game_detail_fast_path", "route_category": "games", "route_intent": "game_detail_lookup", "confidence": 0.96, "elapsed": 0.0064, "sources": [{"id": "our_games", "url": "https://esports.phuket.psu.ac.th/Services/our-games"}, {"id": "Reservation", "url": "https://esports.computing.psu.ac.th/reservation"}], "entities": {"day": null, "time_slots": [], "service": null, "user_group": null, "duration": null, "price_intent": false, "short_answer": false, "comparison_intent": false, "raw": {"normalized_query": "beat saber เล่นยังไง", "language_hint": "mixed_th_en"}}, "validation": {"ok": true, "errors": [], "warnings": []}, "trace": [{"stage": "preprocess", "decision": "normalized", "confidence": 1.0, "detail": "beat saber เล่นยังไง", "metadata": {"language_hint": "mixed_th_en"}}, {"stage": "entities", "decision": "extracted", "confidence": 0.9, "detail": "", "metadata": {"day": null, "time_slots": [], "service": null, "user_group": null, "duration": null, "price_intent": false}}, {"stage": "guard", "decision": "domain_ok", "confidence": 0.9, "detail": "domain hints found", "metadata": {}}, {"stage": "router", "decision": "games", "confidence": 0.95, "detail": "specific game detail terms found", "metadata": {"intent": "game_detail_lookup", "answer_type": "fact"}}, {"stage": "deterministic", "decision": "answer_games", "confidence": 0.96, "detail": "game_detail_fast_path", "metadata": {}}, {"stage": "validation", "decision": "ok", "confidence": 1.0, "detail": "", "metadata": {}}]}
{"question": "อะไรคือ Cockpit", "answer": "Cockpit Zone คือโซนจำลองการขับรถ/เกมแข่งรถ ใช้เล่น Gran Turismo 7 ด้วยชุดพวงมาลัยและเบาะขับ\nวิธีใช้งานโดยสรุป: จอง Cockpit Zone แล้วนั่งในชุด Cockpit ใช้พวงมาลัย Logitech G923 พร้อมคันเร่ง/เบรก/คันเกียร์เพื่อควบคุมรถในเกม\nอุปกรณ์หลัก: TV 65 นิ้ว 2 เครื่อง (2 Units), Logitech G923 TRUEFORCE Racing wheel + Driving Force Shifter 2 ชุด (2 Units), Racezone Full Cockpit V3 2 ชุด (2 Units) และ Pulse Elite Wireless Headset 2 ชุด (2 Units)\nเกม/การใช้งานที่ยืนยันได้: Gran Turismo 7 (Single Player)\nแหล่งข้อมูล: https://esports.phuket.psu.ac.th/home", "mode": "pipeline:equipment_zone_fast_path", "route_category": "equipment", "route_intent": "zone_equipment_lookup", "confidence": 0.95, "elapsed": 0.004, "sources": [{"id": "home", "url": "https://esports.phuket.psu.ac.th/home"}], "entities": {"day": null, "time_slots": [], "service": "cockpit", "user_group": null, "duration": null, "price_intent": false, "short_answer": false, "comparison_intent": false, "raw": {"normalized_query": "อะไรคือ cockpit", "language_hint": "mixed_th_en"}}, "validation": {"ok": true, "errors": [], "warnings": []}, "trace": [{"stage": "preprocess", "decision": "normalized", "confidence": 1.0, "detail": "อะไรคือ cockpit", "metadata": {"language_hint": "mixed_th_en"}}, {"stage": "entities", "decision": "extracted", "confidence": 0.9, "detail": "", "metadata": {"day": null, "time_slots": [], "service": "cockpit", "user_group": null, "duration": null, "price_intent": false}}, {"stage": "guard", "decision": "domain_ok", "confidence": 0.9, "detail": "domain hints found", "metadata": {}}, {"stage": "router", "decision": "equipment", "confidence": 0.94, "detail": "zone/equipment terms found", "metadata": {"intent": "zone_equipment_lookup", "answer_type": "fact"}}, {"stage": "deterministic", "decision": "answer_equipment", "confidence": 0.95, "detail": "equipment_zone_fast_path", "metadata": {}}, {"stage": "validation", "decision": "ok", "confidence": 1.0, "detail":